WEBVTT - Immich Deployment Walkthrough

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:07.360
Welcome to NjordDeploy. Let's start an automated discovery scan to locate nodes on our network.

2
00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:25.110
Virtual Pi 5 discovered at 192.168.1.185. Entering SSH credentials for verification.

3
00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:40.010
Hardware verified: 8 gigabytes of RAM and 64 gigabytes of storage. Ready for the software catalog.

4
00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:53.150
Under Media Servers, selecting Immich: complete photo suite with AI recognition and PostgreSQL.

5
00:01:10.890 --> 00:01:17.810
Deployment complete! All four microservices are deployed via Docker and verified healthy.

6
00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:25.330
Launch the Immich Web UI instantly with one click on port 2283.

7
00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:35.290
Here is the live Immich web interface, ready for instant use directly on your local network.
